{"ref":"BDB, נְטֹפָה","hw":"נְטֹפָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נְטֹפָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> in Judah <strong>(</strong><em>dropping, dripping</em>, cf. Lewy<sup>Sem. Fremdwörter 40</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:22\" href=\"/Ezra.2.22\">Ezr 2:22</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:25\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.25\">Ne 7:26</a>; 𝔊 Νετωφα, 𝔊L Νετωφατι (as adj. gent. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:28\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.28\">Ne 12:28</a>).","next":"BDB, נְטֹפָתִי","prev":"BDB, נְטִיפָה?"}